OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin patches feel the heat
OL,4,Aafter summer drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FPumpkins have become an essential part
OL,7,Fof Halloween, whether as haunting
OL,8,FJack-o'-lanterns or warming soups and
OL,9,Fpies, but has the extreme heat during
OL,10,Fthe summer affected this year's harvest
OL,11,Fof the much-loved fruit?
OL,13,FSummer 2026 was the UK's hottest on
OL,14,Frecord, with five widespread heatwaves
OL,15,Fand 40 days of temperatures above 30C
OL,16,F(86F), beating the previous record of
OL,17,F34 days.
