OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin patches feel the heat
OL,4,Aafter summer drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result of the drought conditions,
OL,7,Fgrowers have reported pumpkins, which
OL,8,Fneed a plentiful water supply while
OL,9,Fgrowing, being smaller in size and
OL,10,Fripening earlier than usual.
OL,12,FEleanor Gilbert regularly shares her
OL,13,Fexperiences of life on her family's
OL,14,FRookery Farm on the Hampshire-Berkshire
OL,15,Fborder, on her Berkshire Farm Girl
OL,16,Fsocial media accounts.
